---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookies policy" description="Information about cookies and local storage on the eduAssets website." locale="en" path="cookies-policy">
  <main class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Cookies policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 12, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Essential storage</h2>
    <p>The site stores in your browser, without personal data:</p>
    <ul><li><code>eduassets-theme</code> (local storage): the chosen visual theme.</li><li><code>eduassets-lang-scroll</code> (session storage): keeps the page position when switching language.</li><li><code>eduassets_analytics_consent</code> (local storage): your statistics cookie choice and its date.</li></ul>
    <h2>Statistics cookies (optional)</h2>
    <p>Only with your consent, Google Analytics sets the <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_9LJ1MQRCEV</code> cookies, which last up to 2 years and count visits in aggregate. Without consent, no Google script is loaded and no cookie is set. The site uses no advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Managing preferences</h2>
    <p>Use the <strong>Cookie preferences</strong> button, in the home page footer or below, to accept or refuse at any time; refusing deletes the Google Analytics cookies. You can also clear the site data in your browser settings. More details in the <a href="/en/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <p><button type="button" class="cookie-preferences-btn" data-open-cookie-preferences>Cookie preferences</button></p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/">Back to the website</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
